(text "IMPLEMENTED CIRCUIT SCOPE\n- Genuine MS3 40-pin, JP2 and injector interfaces.\n- Eight sequential injector channels.\n- Eight smart-coil outputs or four optional stock power drivers.\n- Crank/cam, analog sensors, switch inputs and auxiliary outputs.\n- External MicroSquirt pass-through harness and brake interface.\n\nNOT IMPLEMENTED AS FACTORY EQUIVALENTS\n- Ford OBD/J1850 link, FEPS programming and readiness monitors.\n- Catalyst, EVAP and EGR diagnostic strategies.\n- Factory keep-alive functions and trip/fuel calculations.\n- A verified OD lamp command from the transmission controller.\n\nElectrical switches for a valve/heater do not recreate its factory\ncontrol or diagnostics. No claim of factory functional parity." (at 225 49 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid b2ab1860-a742-520e-aa33-1a23ba7bcdfe))
(text "UNRESOLVED RELEASE ITEMS\nFinal connector/IC footprints; full PCB outline and mounting coordinates; current/thermal budget;\nfirmware pin availability and output polarity; transmission range/speed selection; real-load testing.\nNo Gerbers, PCB routing, production BOM or vehicle-ready tune are included in Revision A1." (at 15 231 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 1c0407c9-a862-5f25-8c45-0f9f1f7de3ad))
